# Keep the build context (and therefore the image, and therefore anything Trivy has to scan)
# free of anything that isn't needed to build/run the API. Also a supply-chain guardrail
# (OWASP A03): if a .env with real values ever exists locally next to this Dockerfile, it
# must never be picked up by `docker build`'s COPY . . in the builder stage.
node_modules
dist
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
coverage
*.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
